The '''Sainte-Croix commune district''' ({{langx|bl|Distrito comuna de Sant Cruz}}) is one of the 2 [[Commune district|legislative districts]] in the [[Maracaju]] [[Cantons of Balisca|canton]] of [[Catanduva]] (14). Like the other 735 Baliscan commune districts, it elects one [[Confederal Congress|delegate]] using the {{W|instant-runoff voting}} system.

